  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      172.82,
      408.17,
      217.58
    ],
    "text": "Issued by the Natural Hazards Early Warning Centre Issued at 10.00 a.m. 22 September 2026, valid for the next 12 hours.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599999785423279,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      142.58,
      220.4,
      472.59,
      244.37
    ],
    "text": "For Multi-day boats in the Bay of Bengal deep sea areas.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.960000038146973,
      14.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      247.85,
      541.39,
      439.73
    ],
    "text": "Take Action! The Depression over West-central and adjoining Northwest Bay of Bengal, moved west-northwestwards, intensified into \u201ca Depression\u201d at 0530 SLST of today, the 22nd September, 2026, over the same region. It is very likely to move west-northwestwards & intensify into a deep depression over West-central & adjoining Northwest Bay of Bengal during next 12 hours. Continuing to move west-northwestwards it is very likely to cross north Andhra Pradesh - South Odisha coasts. The wind speed in the sea areas marked under the \u201cAdvisory\u201d category on the map below will increase to (55-65) kmph at times and those sea areas will be rough or very rough at times.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0,
      15.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      448.39,
      542.81,
      494.11
    ],
    "text": "Wind speeds in the sea areas marked under the \u201cWarning\u201d category may increase to 70kmph at times, heavy thundershowers can occur, and the sea conditions in these areas will become very rough.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      504.91,
      542.8,
      831.24
    ],
    "text": "Naval and fishing communities are warned not to venture to the sea areas in between 5\u00b0N and 22\u00b0N latitude and 85\u00b0E and 100\u00b0E longitude until further notice. Naval and fishing communities operating in those sea areas are advised to move away from the affected sea areas.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      856.68,
      540.92,
      952.92
    ],
    "text": "Navel and fishing communities engaging the activities over this sea area are advised to be vigilant and be attentive to the future forecasts and bulletins issued by the department of meteorology in this regards.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
